      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[student@workstation ~]$ oc get template -n redhat-ods-applications\nNAME                                               DESCRIPTION                                                                        PARAMETERS    OBJECTS\nguardrails-detector-huggingface-serving-template   Guardrails detector Hugging Face serving runtime for KServe                        0 (all set)   1\nkserve-ovms                                        OpenVino Model Serving Definition                                                  0 (all set)   1\nmlserver-runtime-template                          MLServer is a lightweight, extensible inference server for serving machine le...   0 (all set)   1\nvllm-cpu-runtime-template                          vLLM is a high-throughput and memory-efficient inference and serving engine f...   0 (all set)   1\nvllm-cpu-x86-runtime-template                      vLLM is a high-throughput and memory-efficient inference and serving engine f...   0 (all set)   1\nvllm-cuda-runtime-template                         vLLM ServingRuntime with CUDA support (for NVIDIA GPUs)                            0 (all set)   1\nvllm-gaudi-runtime-template                        vLLM ServingRuntime to support Gaudi(for Habana AI processors)                     0 (all set)   1\nvllm-multinode-runtime-template                    vLLM is a high-throughput and memory-efficient inference and serving engine f...   0 (all set)   1\nvllm-rocm-runtime-template                         vLLM ServingRuntime to support ROCm (for AMD GPUs)                                 0 (all set)   1\nvllm-spyre-ppc64le-runtime-template                vLLM ServingRuntime to support IBM Spyre                                           0 (all set)   1\nvllm-spyre-s390x-runtime-template                  vLLM ServingRuntime to support IBM Spyre                                           0 (all set)   1\nvllm-spyre-x86-runtime-template                    vLLM ServingRuntime to support IBM Spyre    ",
