      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793625636166,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "Making an Inference is :\n\n    ° Figuring out something based on what :\n        - what you already know\n        or\n        - what you can observe\n\n    ° It is like making a smart guess using the \n      information you have\n\n    ° It is important that you remember that \n      your inference is NOT a definitive answer, but\n      just a really good guess",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Making an Inference is :\n\n    ° Figuring out something based on what :\n        - what you already know\n        or\n        - what you can observe\n\n    ° It is like making a smart guess using the \n      information you have\n\n    ° It is important that you remember that \n      your inference is NOT a definitive answer, but\n      just a really good guess",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793625631951,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "type": "arrow",
