      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> Deployment :\n    ° Once the model is trained, it needs to live somewhere\n\n\n    ° In the Cloud :\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    ° On-premises\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    ° On edge devices :",
